    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϋτή</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔω</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry,
			shout,</i> esp. <i>battle-shout, war-cry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϋτὴ δ᾽ οὐρανὸν ἷκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.153
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϋτή τε πτόλεμός τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.328
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνος ὀξείας ἀϋτᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					9.35
				</span></i>
			: generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλώσσης ἀϋτὴν Φωκίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					564
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>blast</i> of the trumpet, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				395
			</span></i>; of the <i>creaking</i> of the axle, <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				1.6
			</span></i>. (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϝῡτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).868
				</span></i>
			 (Corc.).)</div>
